text 0 golden/help.files

text 428 golden/help.out
gputilttest runs the tilt program repeatedly to test whether a GPU
    gives reproducible results
Usage:  gputilttest [-P[ID]] [-l] [#_of_minutes] [GPU_#]
    #_of_minutes sets how long the test will run; the default
        is 1 minute, fractional values are allowed
   GPU_# is the # of the GPU to test, numbered from 1,
        or 0 for the bext or only GPU
   -l option will leave the log file gputest.log from the last run

